  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Rehabilitacin y Modernizacin de la Central Hidroelctrica Acaray - Monto Suplementario</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation and Modernization Program for the Acaray Hydropower Plant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la modernizacin del sector elctrico de Paraguaya travs del financiamiento de inversiones de rehabilitacin de infraestructura elctrica de la Administracin Nacional deElectricidad (ANDE). El objetivo especfico es apoyar a la ANDE a rehabilitar y modernizar la Central Hidroelctrica Acaraypara contribuir a: (i) la extensin de su vida til; (ii) mejorar su disponibilidad y confiabilidad; e (iii) incrementar su capacidad de generacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to help modernize Paraguay&apos;s electricity sector by financing investment to rehabilitate ANDE&apos;s electricity infrastructure. The specific objective is to assist ANDE in rehabilitating and modernizing the Acaray Hydroelectric Power Plant in order to: (i) extend its useful life; (ii) enhance its availability and reliability; and (iii) boost its generation capacity</narrative>
  </description>
